WEBVTT

00:00:59.996 --> 00:01:02.916
or you can extend it out
and roll it round your mouth,

00:01:02.956 --> 00:01:04.596
"cuuunt."

00:01:06.636 --> 00:01:08.556
I love its dexterity.

00:01:08.596 --> 00:01:12.436
I love the fact that in Scotland
it’s a term of endearment,

00:01:12.436 --> 00:01:15.796
but in America
it's horrendously offensive.

00:01:16.116 --> 00:01:18.596
I love it means something
different with your friends

00:01:18.636 --> 00:01:20.596
than it does if you said it to your boss,

00:01:20.636 --> 00:01:22.356
it would probably cost you your job.

00:01:22.396 --> 00:01:24.476
I do not recommend it.

00:01:24.516 --> 00:01:26.196
I love this word.

00:01:26.236 --> 00:01:27.476
(Laughter)

00:01:27.476 --> 00:01:29.596
I love the fact
that the first three letters

00:01:29.636 --> 00:01:31.836
are still the same chalice shape,